<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Nestle.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Nestle.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued three million American-style call warrant on Nestle registered shares, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>Twenty warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1400 CHF		  PREMIUM	8.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.90 CHF		  GEARING	10.4 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 19.NOV.96-19.JUN.98   PAYDATE	18.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1412 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
